utors.\n\n[+] Combat:\n> Aiming:\n- Silent Aim (FOV, Wall Check, Hit Chance)\n- Aimbot (FOV, Wall Check)\n> Gun Mods:\n- No Spread\n- No Cooldowns\n- No Recoil\n- No Fire Rate\n- Shotgun One Shot (Increases bullet count to max shots)\n- Max Shots (Sets gun's clip value to the reserve ammo you have)\n- Infinite Ammo (Patched)\n\n[+] Visuals:\n- Animal ESP\n- ESP (Health, Name, Display Name, Distance)\n- Tracers (Bottom, Mouse, Center)\n- Boxes (3D, 2D)\n- Head Dots\n- Crosshair\n\n[+] Character:\n- Rob Cash Registers Aura\n- Anti Ragdoll\n- No Fall Damage\n- No Jump Cooldown\n- Collect / Teleport Dropped Cash\n- Auto Heal\n- Auto Break Free\n- Instant Context Action (Rob, Take, Crack Safe, Struggle...)\n- Instant Respawn (Patched)\n- Edit WalkSpeed & JumpPower\n- Force Respawn\n- Remove Nametag\n- Become Cowboy\n- Become Outlaw\n\n[+] Miscellaneous:\n- Full Bright\n- Full Bright Ambient Color\n- Anti AFK\n- Optimize GPU + CPU Usage When Window Unfocused\n- Set FPS Cap (Boost FPS)\n- Fly (Patched)\n- Rejoin Game\n\nContact Information:\n- Discord: aleksandar#2026\n- E-Mail: exunys@gang.email","tags":["esp","aimbot","silent aim","rob aura","auto heal"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"64dcd01b12707f65eb9d8eb7","username":"Exunys","verified":true,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8ffebcbeeac46722a52e57754d13a8859278e59f52d800971325a7ba7dd3185d.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/64dcd01b12707f65eb9d8eb7-1692194384142.gif"},"lvl":8,"status":"offline","id":"64dcd01b12707f65eb9d8eb7","leaderboard":{"tag":null},"topMilestone":{"key":"creator.chart_topper","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8ffebcbeeac46722a52e57754d13a8859278e59f52d800971325a7ba7dd3185d.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/64dcd01b12707f65eb9d8eb7-1692194384142.gif"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":fal